    excerpt: 'Camphor oil (CAS 8008-51-3) is a complex essential oil obtained by steam distillation of camphor tree wood. Available in white, yellow, and brown grades with very different chemical compositions, each grade has distinct industrial applications. This guide covers the complete camphor oil spectrum.',
